B.Gq=new A.ec("WordToob - Language Learning with Video Modeling","WordToob is an engaging learning application designed to make vocabulary and skill-building both fun and effective. It combines pre-stored and user-customized videos to enhance retention and interactivity. Users can easily personalize their learning experience by adding their own videos, creating a powerful and immersive way to learn new words and concepts.\nThe app is built with Flutter for cross-platform development, using flutter_tts for text-to-speech functionality to help with pronunciation and auditory learning. SqfLite is integrated for efficient local data storage, ensuring fast access and offline capability.","https://itunes.apple.com/us/app/wordtoob-language-learning/id651639627?ls=1&mt=8")
B.Gv=new A.ec("Shop - Go","Comprehensive Flutter app integrating courier service websites to provide secure, convenient shipping. Laravel PHP backend handles data management and auth. Includes in-app web view, real-time tracking, secure payments, and user profiles for a seamless courier experience.","https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=co.proglabs.shop_go&pcampaignid=web_share")
B.Go=new A.ec("Christian Business Finder","Flutter app connecting users with businesses. Implemented secure PHP (Laravel) backend to protect data and restrict unauthorized access. Features detailed business info, user registration, and church-centric discovery for a seamless, privacy-focused platform.","https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.cbf.christian_business_finder&pcampaignid=web_share")
